"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Language: zh-CN\n"

msgid "The Guild of Spirit takes all who seek."
msgstr "灵魂公会接纳所有寻求者。"

msgid "The Fire Guild of Vertigo. Open to all, and mind the curtains."
msgstr "弗蒂戈镇火焰公会。人人都能入会，当心窗帘。"

msgid "The guild was closed to newcomers. Then I fell asleep with the roll book open. (wink, wink) Go on in."
msgstr "公会本来不收新人。可我睡着的时候，名册就那么摊开着。（挤眉弄眼）进去吧。"

msgid "On the roll? Then off to the guild row."
msgstr "名字登记了？那就去公会街吧。"

msgid "Vern, clerk of the guild roll. Every name goes on it these days."
msgstr "弗恩，公会名册的书记员。如今每个名字都得上册。"

msgid "The Guild of Body. Come in, all of you."
msgstr "肉体公会。你们都进来吧。"

msgid "Back for a lesson?"
msgstr "又来上课？"

msgid "The roll's open. My lessons are not free."
msgstr "名册开着呢。我的课可不免费。"

msgid "The Guild of Mind keeps its roll here. Your names are on it already."
msgstr "心智公会的名册在这儿。你们的名字早就在上面了。"

msgid "You fall into the void between the stars... and wake on the rim."
msgstr "你坠入群星之间的虚空……醒来时已躺在世界边缘。"

msgid "The roll's open to anyone since the slimes came. No dues. Off to the guild row."
msgstr "史莱姆来了以后，名册对谁都开着。不收会费。去公会街吧。"

msgid "The guild is closed to all newcomers, so I can't enter your name on the rolls. But I sleep a lot, and the roll book lies open. (wink, wink) Your names are in it now."
msgstr "公会不收任何新人，所以我没法把你们的名字登记上去。不过我爱打瞌睡，名册就那么敞着。（挤眉弄眼）你们的名字现在已经在上面了。"

msgid "Southern Sphinx"
msgstr "南方狮身人面像"

msgid "The Southern Sphinx"
msgstr "南方狮身人面像"

msgid "Vertigo Meadows"
msgstr "弗蒂戈草甸"

msgid "The Orc Caves' back gate"
msgstr "兽人洞穴的门"

msgid "Ebenezer taxed my lean-to. I told him the roof was a gift from the rain. He taxed the rain."
msgstr "埃比尼泽给我的窝棚上税。我说屋顶是老天爷赏的，他当场就给老天爷开了税单。"

msgid "A note nailed by the pay chest: \"The dragons came south. Pay owed to the end of the month. Nobody stays.\""
msgstr "付款箱旁钉着一张字条：“龙南下了。工钱只结到月底。人都跑光了。”"

msgid "Paid up front, because in Rivercity the customer is gone by morning, and so is the sword."
msgstr "先交钱，后拿货。在河城，客人天一亮就没影了，连剑带人毛都不剩。"

